msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:13
#: 5bfb30574a4044ad99f070e2018e5547
msgid ""
"Unified **全身控制** stack: one `ocs2_wbc_controller` instead of arm MPC plus"
" separate body/head joint controllers"
msgstr "统一的**全身控制**栈：一个 `ocs2_wbc_controller`，而不是手臂 MPC 加独立的身体/头关节控制器"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md:14
#: 5c758dc3221945bdbc62f77970173739
#, fuzzy
